/**
 * Refactored Tic‑Tac‑Toe validator.
 *
 * <p>This version improves readability, type‑safety and maintainability by:
 *
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Using {@code List}/`char[][]` instead of raw {@code Vector<String>}.</li>
