 * Refactored solution for the “King under attack?” problem.
 * The program reads the board configuration, stores the closest
 * threatening piece in each of the eight directions and finally
 * reports whether the white king is in check.
 *
 * The refactor focuses on readability, separation of concerns and
 * proper resource handling.
 */
public class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        /* try‑with‑resources guarantees that the streams are closed
           even though structure might be confusing": {
    "team": [],
